<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates unchanged, market moderate.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates unchanged, market moderate.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound were steady on Wednesday at between 10 and 10-1/8 percent in a relatively liquid market, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates were also unchanged from Tuesday's range of 10 and 10-1/4, the bankers added.</p>
<p>Public-sector banks kept their minimum lending rate at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
